

Working Rules
Be fast.
Every response must contain an action, question, or request.
No unnecessary progress updates.
No discussions without an actionable outcome.
No future enhancements during the current task.
Discuss future ideas only at the end of the session.
Avoid "good-to-have" ideas unless they provide clear value to TABELA.
Code Delivery Rules
Single patch: Provide the patch only.
Multiple patches, file ≤250 lines: Provide the complete replacement file (inline or upload).
Multiple patches, file >250 lines: Provide complete replacement functions. Replace the entire file only if uploading the full file is practical.

Verify every code change before moving on.
If there is any issue, provide the exact replacement code to copy/paste.
Do not assume a patch was applied correctly.
Move to the next task only after verification passes.